{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1102990-how-viable-is-a-chronicle-set-mainly-in-the-astral","id":1102990,"title":"How viable is a chronicle set mainly in the Astral?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-06-12T19:24:15-07:00","id":1102990,"title":"How viable is a chronicle set mainly in the Astral?","content":"I'm sketching out ideas for a short Mage chronicle, probably just one or two stories long. My basic pitch is I want the players to be responsible for a Temenos realm representing some idea that they cherish, probably an &quot;ideal city&quot; designed with their input, and they have to improve it and defend it against a siege by enemies (Seers, goetia, Acamoth, etc) who oppose that ideal and want to subvert or destroy the city. I really want to lean into the Mage themes of using your power and changing the world based on your ideals and Obsessions, using the setting of a literal besieged city. I'm drawing on stories like Inception, the Matrix, and Persona where the &quot;waking world&quot; is a side story and the fantastic magical action happens in the &quot;dream world,&quot; but they're linked.<br /> <br /> Here's what I want to get some more eyes on: what would be the risks and pitfalls of centering the action in the Astral Realms? Are certain Arcana or abilities going to be radically more or less useful, even in a realm that mostly mimics the real world? (Assume it has ghosts and spirits.) Is the Astral less meaningful without as much waking world action for comparison? Is a city-sized Temenos realm any more cramped as a setting than a normal city? Are individual Oneiroi and the Anima Mundi still fun to use when we're already in the Astral a lot?<br /> <br /> Tell me what I should be thinking about when I want to run a chronicle whose main city setting is in the Temenos!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-13T00:58:15-07:00","id":1103035,"title":"","content":"Are 'Astral Shadow' and 'Astral Underworld' in Temenos ( and it sounds as it is )? If yes, then ANY Arcanum will be same useful as in Waked World. Just in general rules for Astral in 2E is that Mind has -2 to Paradox rolls in Astral.<br /> <br /> As to general possibility of whole Astral run chronicle - I do not see large problems. As any character can Astral journey in any Hollow in 2E, you only need to take this in consideration. <i>Astral Adept</i> Merit even let you bypass this restriction.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-13T08:59:26-07:00","id":1103153,"title":"","content":"Also, it might be interesting to figure out what is going on with their real bodies. How are they being secured? How are they being fed? etc... That could lead to a situation where some Seers attack a fellow cabal's secure place and kill the Mages while they are in the Astral. Maybe have some Seers attack them in the Astral with something that prevents them from getting back to their bodies. Race against time and all that...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1470-johnny-awesome","name":"Johnny Awesome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1470_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"447"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}